From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000007 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@localhost>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] runtime: preserve heartbeat and add opt-in instruction provenance

Preserve heartbeat service in diagnostic/profile dispatch paths and report
current uncached-emitter registers accurately. Add pre-instruction history,
fault context, delay-slot-aware generated observers and synthetic coverage.

---
